MINI_TEXTUAL_DATA = """The interstellar spaceship, designated Star-Cruiser Alpha, accelerated continuously through the uncharted sectors of the galaxy. The continuous acceleration caused a low-frequency hum, vibrating endlessly through the metallic bulkheads. Inside the command module, the commander closely monitored the navigational instruments, checking and rechecking the calculated trajectories. Navigation was undeniably the most complicated and demanding task during interstellar travel.

Unexpectedly, the proximity sensors activated, flashing brightly and blinking red warnings across the main console. An unidentified celestial object was rapidly approaching their current position. The commander immediately initiated the automated evasive maneuvers, hoping the ship's thrusters would respond quickly enough. "Engineering, we need maximum power diverted to the maneuvering thrusters!" she shouted urgently over the intercom.

Down in the engineering bay, the chief engineer frantically typed commands into the overriding terminal. Sparks flew unpredictably from an overloaded conduit, but the engineer remained focused, completely undeterred by the dangerous environment. He successfully bypassed the damaged circuits, restoring functionality just in time.

The Star-Cruiser Alpha swerved violently, narrowly avoiding a massive, slowly spinning asteroid covered in reflective, crystalline structures. The crew breathed a collective sigh of relief, thankful for the successful evasion. Their interstellar journey would continue, pushing further into the unknown, continuously exploring the endless mysteries of the universe."""